\title{calibration: Ensemble Parameter Calibration for Process-Based Ecosystem Models}
\description{
Method-agnostic ensemble calibration of process-based ecosystem model parameters against field observations. A generic driver dispatches to a calibration method (Ensemble Kalman Inversion first); observation targets and priors are built from curated data and PEcAn trait priors, and a forward-model adapter runs the ensemble through a PEcAn-configured model. Reuses PEcAn for the model run, unit conversion, and trait priors, and is not tied to any one model, site, or variable.
